The advertising campaign that will accompany the debut of the new car launched an unpublished form of communication through a 3D advertising campaign, used for the first time in Italy by a car brand.
A project with maxi-posters, articulated in three different phases, that dominates the central street of Milanese shopping, Como Avenue, until November 15.
